AltoStaking::pause() - Rescue Mode Disable Prevention
├── given rescue mode is not enabled
│   ├── when enabling rescue mode
│   │   └── it should enable rescue mode successfully
│   └── when disabling rescue mode
│       └── it should revert with AltoStakingInvalidInput
├── given rescue mode is enabled
│   ├── when attempting to disable rescue mode
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoStakingInvalidInput
│   ├── when attempting to enable rescue mode again
│   │   └── it should revert with StateNotChanged
│   ├── when rescue mode pauser tries to disable
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoStakingInvalidInput
│   ├── when owner tries to disable rescue mode
│   │   └── it should revert with AltoStakingInvalidInput
│   └── when disabling rescue mode after other operations
│       └── it should revert with AltoStakingInvalidInput
└── given normal pause mode operations
    ├── when enabling normal pause
    │   └── it should enable normal pause successfully
    ├── when disabling normal pause
    │   └── it should disable normal pause successfully
    └── when rescue mode is enabled and normal pause operations
        ├── when enabling normal pause
        │   └── it should enable normal pause successfully
        └── when disabling normal pause
            └── it should disable normal pause successfully
